    },
    {
      "id": "u_24c601d53b8d507865d8c061_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Starting with v0.104.0, some features in Trilium are intentionally disabled in order to reduce the attack surface:",
      "sourceHash": "24c601d53b8d507865d8c0618a3856152346852b7be5831c8f29cdf769194157",
      "context": "Security",
      "contextHash": "8f6fb4eb7f42c0e245e29e63f5b82cc3ba19852681d1ed9aed291f59cf75ec0e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_741616777ec8e95f333f494e_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Backend scripts__TRILIUM_PH_1__, which can run processes on the server, access the file system or bypass security measures.",
      "sourceHash": "741616777ec8e95f333f494eca4ccbfbee7a92fb0273ff4b1a4607ec8045dcdf",
      "context": "Security",
      "contextHash": "8f6fb4eb7f42c0e245e29e63f5b82cc3ba19852681d1ed9aed291f59cf75ec0e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_0f1d692d6d940ec0e15648fd_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__SQL Console__TRILIUM_PH_1__, which can be used to exfiltrate important data such as the document secret or cause irreparable damage to the database.",
      "sourceHash": "0f1d692d6d940ec0e15648fd6fffdeacc8e90c9ad5f30951abe57ce93b0809cb",
      "context": "Security",
      "contextHash": "8f6fb4eb7f42c0e245e29e63f5b82cc3ba19852681d1ed9aed291f59cf75ec0e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_406804a10431a041fa531db2_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Network Access__TRILIUM_PH_1__ for the __TRILIUM_PH_2__Desktop Installation__TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "406804a10431a041fa531db23b28b2b3a6456be512cad1496799e9c41a145bdd",
      "context": "Security",
      "contextHash": "8f6fb4eb7f42c0e245e29e63f5b82cc3ba19852681d1ed9aed291f59cf75ec0e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8878d8b25a759d3b24c722aa_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To activate any of them, there are three variants:",
      "sourceHash": "8878d8b25a759d3b24c722aa9bdaac76799cadbe3faa68089461bf5d0a379add",
      "context": "Security",
      "contextHash": "8f6fb4eb7f42c0e245e29e63f5b82cc3ba19852681d1ed9aed291f59cf75ec0e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_da9463c6da6fd2fe98b9e07b_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "For the desktop app, go to __TRILIUM_PH_0__Options__TRILIUM_PH_1__ → __TRILIUM_PH_2__Security__TRILIUM_PH_3__ and toggle the desired option.",
      "sourceHash": "da9463c6da6fd2fe98b9e07bc1b535019281fdc000c19394c600ff58f617134e",
      "context": "Security",
      "contextHash": "8f6fb4eb7f42c0e245e29e63f5b82cc3ba19852681d1ed9aed291f59cf75ec0e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_aea4828ad27e661dd38b8e59_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "This will prompt a system dialog confirming the change. Note that scripts could potentially call this confirmation dialog as well, make sure to accept it only if enabling any of these features is required.",
      "sourceHash": "aea4828ad27e661dd38b8e593baffbab7bc0d3f690cd890d7665a310e1969159",
      "context": "Security",
      "contextHash": "8f6fb4eb7f42c0e245e29e63f5b82cc3ba19852681d1ed9aed291f59cf75ec0e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_865b6508b10103eb38cfb84d_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The settings page will be available for the server-side as well, but the options need to be manually toggled using the other mechanisms described here.",
      "sourceHash": "865b6508b10103eb38cfb84d02f382257cafd9acde6950134829fc8ba631b5a2",
      "context": "Security",
      "contextHash": "8f6fb4eb7f42c0e245e29e63f5b82cc3ba19852681d1ed9aed291f59cf75ec0e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f254f3ddd978ef272b46692e_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "This works by setting a separate configuration file in the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Data directory__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "f254f3ddd978ef272b46692e156620c79e323cce81b44fddc5b2e841dadcca7d",
      "context": "Security",
      "contextHash": "8f6fb4eb7f42c0e245e29e63f5b82cc3ba19852681d1ed9aed291f59cf75ec0e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d927c436a9594ac1682710f3_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "In __TRILIUM_PH_0__config.ini__TRILIUM_PH_1__, set the corresponding option under the __TRILIUM_PH_2__ group.",
      "sourceHash": "d927c436a9594ac1682710f3fb42383d840aee17cc6ce9c6f0835119e23fa422",
      "context": "Security",
      "contextHash": "8f6fb4eb7f42c0e245e29e63f5b82cc3ba19852681d1ed9aed291f59cf75ec0e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_78b2f407e2965dc80e6421af_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Or use environment variables (e.g. __TRILIUM_PH_0__).",
      "sourceHash": "78b2f407e2965dc80e6421af3b32664f7eab970660f9e71001bc9dbf54e599d4",
      "context": "Security",
      "contextHash": "8f6fb4eb7f42c0e245e29e63f5b82cc3ba19852681d1ed9aed291f59cf75ec0e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    }
  ],
  "requests": []
}
